{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "022baecbfcc35c96ae4844b728b0a8f0619fd0e94e82c6ae53c38c3238adcc51", "ja": "どうせなら、劇場のみんなと遊べるのがいいよね。\nうーん、どんなゲームがいいんだろう……？", "zh": "既然这样，还是能和剧场的大家一起玩的比较好吧。\n嗯——玩什么游戏好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "80de6bc70b3e01e5966129ebefc75a708ead02f1e38945a4ff293316236c3dae", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\n何か悩んでいるみたいですけど、どうしましたか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n您好像在烦恼什么，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "a856197a167cb4cb5866437b6c43bf9616d70939b03ef42368fb007b3e4aaac1", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nいえ、悩みというほどのことでは……えへへ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n没什么，也算不上烦恼……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "504fa26731de9acde70198fdfdb8d0abd5a04305cb3b01c5a9dc2caf0b7b0695", "ja": "なにか新しく、ゲームを買おうと思って。\nどんなのがいいかなぁって、考えてたんです。", "zh": "我想买款新游戏。\n正在想买什么样的比较好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "71098394e1a6a4a1069d1a6a57deb90fd98dd4a1442cc1e157be0c9a1bcb9d41", "ja": "ゲームですか？　確かに今、色々ありますからね。", "zh": "是游戏吗？确实，现在有各种各样的游戏呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "5a04b67b231d0bb7d78b4976e6eef8e0858a7be4d53c02a38c9c5874d76fe89c", "ja": "はい！　特に最近は……VR？っていうのもある\nみたいで、本当にすごいなぁって。", "zh": "是的！尤其是最近，好像还有一种叫……VR？的东西，真的让人觉得好厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "7a8c9438914793499c949e88a55cd37cb5bf3b20e2d7bbfdef3c21b6d452ac74", "ja": "きっとゲームの世界をお散歩しているだけでも\n楽しくて、ず～っと夢中になっちゃいそうです♪", "zh": "光是在游戏世界里散散步，肯定也会很开心，让人一直沉浸其中呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0cb75b16e2e076cc892485464e20bab435b1aeda810eacc37027df020c7bbca6", "ja": "そうですね。\nCGの技術とか、かなり進歩してるみたいですし。", "zh": "是啊。CG技术之类的好像进步了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "eeff4d9d9d2db118b6c027de6c1d09227b513980174e9947fe4ad8c27c532b80", "ja": "はい！　もしかしたら、いつかゲームの中で本当に身体\nを動かしたり、ご飯の味がしたり、風を感じたり……。", "zh": "是的！说不定有一天，在游戏里真的可以让身体\n动起来，尝到饭菜的味道，感受到风……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "6a8d5315108ac903e6e9dd25df52b2ddb9944f820acd6752f0c17541b6e9cef9", "ja": "ライブができたり、衣装が一瞬で作れたり！\n……できるようになるかもしれませんね♪", "zh": "说不定还能举办演唱会，或者瞬间制作出服装呢！\n……也许将来真的能做到吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "eb920d3b972099feb8d36e66bc7c92ad96507fdd0a8ac2e32100e29f14a59a49", "ja": "そうですね！　そんなゲームならアイドル達みんな、\nまずは夢中で遊びそうですけど……。", "zh": "是啊！如果是那样的游戏，偶像们肯定都会先玩得入迷吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "225b8f501ad644608d013ff28c1d39e6c6cc5e590b6b5278c1103ad48bd17607", "ja": "っと、アイドルといえば！　これから瑞希たちの\nレッスンの立ち会いでした。ちょっと行ってきますね！", "zh": "对了，说到偶像！我接下来还要去旁听瑞希她们的课程。先过去一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "105aae9331840b88e45f33a774394152e18732f406c6f1f5bae204986bcc5ec6", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃい！　そんなゲームができたら\n{$P$}さんも一緒に遊びましょうね♪", "zh": "好——路上小心！要是能做出那样的游戏，也和{$P$}先生一起玩吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "f94f6a7f1a8e627c41badbfb290f5fde571752418a7756d1f7fdc66844efdd0a", "ja": "きっと、こんな感じでゲームを始めるんだよね？\n「リンクスタート！」って……。", "zh": "一定会像这样开始游戏吧？\n“连接开始！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "f5f539f74ffea0f5a97160d74e2a930eaf5708e2b01438ced4b2d324e19ebb4a", "ja": "え？　……あれ？", "zh": "咦？……奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "f684e2acbd8b26d9cd5aedc1c7a7fc3839d50e977b11aa437e70b3b3e29592b6", "ja": "虚空に浮かぶ、石と鉄の巨城―", "zh": "漂浮在虚空中的石铁巨城——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1016_null", "source_sha256": "1b128d3ea97dff2118ca8e6c5ee55a95478a21b7969bff7257fc2db7ca4994ba", "ja": "あるいは、大いなる世界樹がそびえる妖精郷―", "zh": "亦或是，矗立着宏伟世界树的妖精之乡——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1017_null", "source_sha256": "525f9d87842f44faef6e391de9794f06012f9a66e0d6964e9546a06c5a4ac00d", "ja": "そして、硝煙の立ち込める最前線。", "zh": "接着，是硝烟弥漫的最前线。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1018_null", "source_sha256": "64cc04aeb6cf2c72b71aa7e451f606a5633a23bb4c5593cc8c8ed106cafe2720", "ja": "幾つもの世界を渡り、幾つもの夢を継いで……", "zh": "跨越无数世界，传承无数梦想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_intro_1019_null", "source_sha256": "32097c366ec3edcfe66f45fc71ccf3d16d39e0573f39dcee95d6454a45036dbf", "ja": "また、新しい世界に出会う。", "zh": "再次与崭新的世界相遇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
